Package: mrvl-sai-pystub
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: libpython3.11 stand-in for vendor Marvell SAI builds
 Some vendor Marvell SAI builds link libpython3.11 for a debug shell that
 syncd never enables. This package satisfies that link at load time; every
 function aborts if it is ever called.
